<title>MALAYSIA: Kejora year net falls to 17.28 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Kejora year net falls to 17.28 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.28   vs	  26.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  8.2    vs	  22.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		   287.94   vs	 182.31</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    25.06   vs	  38.12</p>
<p>    Minorities		   nil    vs  less   0.01</p>
<p>    Net dividend (cents)     2.8    vs	   3.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Kejora Harta Bhd is engaged in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
